{
  "id": "1SA.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samweli 6",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esanduku y'Endagano ekaikara omu nsi y'Abafilisiti emyezi mushanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisiti beta abakuhani n'abafumu bababaza bati, “Esanduku y'Omukama tugigire tutai? Mutumanyise okwo turagigarurayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuhani n'abafumu babagira bati, “Kamuragarurayo Esanduku ya Ruhanga wa Isiraeli, mutagigarurayo bushai. Mugire ekyo mwagitaho kuliha obufu bwanyu nirwo murakira. Aho nirwo muramanya ekyo abaire naikara ababonaboneize.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisiti babaza bati, “Ndihiki eyo turamugilira?” Bagamba bati, “Ebizimba by'ezahabu bitanu n'embeba z'ezahabu itanu, kuhonderana n'orubara rw'abatwazi banyu, okuba inywena hamoi n'abatwazi banyu muteirwe ekibundo kimoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo mukore ebishushani by'ebizimba byanyu, n'eby'embeba zanyu ezilikwita ensi, mara muhe Ruhanga wa Isiraeli ekitinwa, rundi yakulekera kubabonabonyia na baruhanga banyu n'ensi yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubaki nimusikiira emitima nka Farao n'Abamisiri? Orwo Ruhanga yabahindwire bafera tirwo bataishwire Abaisiraeli bakagenda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonu mbwenu kwata egali emoi empya muzikome aha nte ibili ezilikwonkya ezitakakomwagaho nkomo, kyonkai enyana ezo muzizihyeho muzishubye omuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwate Esanduku y'Omukama mugite omu gali, kandi eshanduku endijo egili aha rubaju mugitemu ebintu by'ezahabu eby'okumulihira mugitaishure egende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mulebe; k'eragenda eyolekeire ensi yayo, Betishemeshi, nikwo kugir'oti Ruhanga wa Isiraeli niwe atuteize ekibundo ky'amani eki. Kakitabaire kityo, turamanya okwo tiwe atuhaire kibonabonyio, kitugwireho bushai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisiti abo bakora batyo. Bakwata ente ibili ezilikwonkya, bazikomaho egali, kandi enyana zazo bazikomerana omu nju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egali bagitamu Esanduku y'Omukama, n'eshanduku elimu embeba z'ezahabu, n'ebishushani by'ebizimba byabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ente zikwatira kimoi nyaihanda elikugya Betishemeshi; zigenda nizijuga, zitalikuhinduka bulyo anga bumosho, mara abatwazi b'Abafilisiti bagenda bazihondeire kulemwa kuhika omu rubibi rwa Betishemeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kanya ako abantu ba Betishemeshi bakaba nibagesha engano omu ruhanga. Kabanagire amaisho bakabona Esanduku bashemelerwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egali egoba omu ndimiro ya Yoshua Omubetishemeshi, eba nimwo eyemelera. Hakaba haliho eibare lihango. Basa emiti y'egali, ente bazitambira Omukama ekitambo ky'okwokibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esanduku y'Omukama n'esanduku eyabaire egili aha rubaju einamu ebintu by'ezahabu, Abalevita bazita aha ibare lihango. Kir'ekyo abantu ba Betishemeshi batambira Omukama ebitambo by'okwokibwa, bamutambira n'ebitambo ebindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatwazi batanu b'Abafilisiti kabaaboine byaba bityo, kiro kyonene ekyo bagaruka Ekironi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi nibyo bizimba by'ezahabu eby'Abafilisiti balesire nk'endihi aha Mukama: Ekya Ashidodi kimoi, ekya Gaza kimoi, ekya Ashikeloni kimoi, ekya Gati kimoi n'ekya Ekironi kimoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'embeba z'ezahabu kuhonderana n'orubara rw'ebigo by'Abafilisiti ezatwarwaga abatwazi batanu bizingoirwe enkuta n'ebyaro. Eibare lihango ely'omu ndimiro ya Yoshua Omubetishemeshi elyo bataireho Esanduku y'Omukama, bujulizi bw'ebyabaireho kugoba mwaha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akaita abantu nshanju ba Betishemeshi okuba bakalinguliza omu Sandukuye. Aho abantu bachura orwo yabateize ekibundo kihango kityo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma abantu ba Betishemeshi bagamba bati, “N'ohai ayakushobora kwemelera omu maisho g'Omukama Ruhanga ogu Omutakatifu? Esanduku egi eturugeho, manya egye owa bahai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho batuma entumwa aha banyansi ba Kiriatiyearimu, nibagamba bati, “Abafilisiti bagarwire Esanduku y'Omukama. Abafilisiti bagigarwire, mwije mugitware owanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
